import keyword
---------------
-If you want to use one module to another module the use 'import' keyword.
-Syntax: import modulename
-Because of import keyword all the members of your module is loaded in your 
 program .
-Now if you want to access data then ->Modulename.variablename
                                     ->Modulename.functionname()
-If you want to import a module from another location then we need to use complete path.
-We can set alias name to your path so we can access your variable and functions by using alias names.
